\import{base-macros}

\p{\code{\verb~|std::hash~} implements \code{\verb~|Hash~} for the primitives (\code{\verb~|u8~}–\code{\verb~|u64~}, \code{\verb~|i8~}–\code{\verb~|i64~}, \code{\verb~|bool~}, \code{\verb~|char~}): each scalar hashes as its own typed write, so primitives feed hashers, \code{\verb~|write~} chains, and hash-container key positions directly.}
